From 477ab607d40dc5c70080634354bbeb3c47da1255 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: taylorjordanNC <taylorjordansmith@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 2 Jun 2026 15:31:05 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Add runtime branding customization support

Enables deployment-time UI branding customization without rebuilding
the frontend image. Branding is loaded from /branding/branding.json
at runtime, with automatic fallback to NVIDIA defaults when no custom
branding is deployed.
